{"page":213,"verses":[{"verse_key":"10:34","surah":10,"ayah":34,"ar_uthmani":"قُلْ هَلْ مِن شُرَكَآئِكُم مَّن يَبْدَؤُا۟ ٱلْخَلْقَ ثُمَّ يُعِيدُهُۥ ۚ قُلِ ٱللَّهُ يَبْدَؤُا۟ ٱلْخَلْقَ ثُمَّ يُعِيدُهُۥ ۖ فَأَنَّىٰ تُؤْفَكُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Ask them, ‘Can any of your partner-gods originate creation, then bring it back to life again in the end?’ Say, ‘It is God that originates creation, and then brings it back to life, so how can you be misled?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"10:34"},{"pos":2,"ar":"هَلْ","en_gloss":"Is (there)","transliteration":"hal","verse_key":"10:34"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"10:34"},{"pos":4,"ar":"شُرَكَآئِكُم","en_gloss":"your partners","transliteration":"shurakāikum","verse_key":"10:34"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَّن","en_gloss":"(any) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"10:34"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَبْدَؤُا۟","en_gloss":"originates","transliteration":"yabda-u","verse_key":"10:34"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْخَلْقَ","en_gloss":"the creation","transliteration":"l-khalqa","verse_key":"10:34"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"10:34"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يُعِيدُهُۥ ۚ","en_gloss":"repeats it","transliteration":"yuʿīduhu","verse_key":"10:34"},{"pos":10,"ar":"قُلِ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"quli","verse_key":"10:34"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"10:34"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَبْدَؤُا۟","en_gloss":"originates","transliteration":"yabda-u","verse_key":"10:34"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْخَلْقَ","en_gloss":"the creation","transliteration":"l-khalqa","verse_key":"10:34"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"10:34"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يُعِيدُهُۥ ۖ","en_gloss":"repeats it","transliteration":"yuʿīduhu","verse_key":"10:34"},{"pos":16,"ar":"فَأَنَّىٰ","en_gloss":"So how","transliteration":"fa-annā","verse_key":"10:34"},{"pos":17,