revealed before it and an explanation of the Scripture- let there be no doubt about it- it is from the Lord of the Worlds.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"10:37"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"10:37"},{"pos":3,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"this","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"10:37"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْقُرْءَانُ","en_gloss":"the Quran","transliteration":"l-qur'ānu","verse_key":"10:37"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"10:37"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يُفْتَرَىٰ","en_gloss":"(it could be) produced","transliteration":"yuf'tarā","verse_key":"10:37"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"by","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"10:37"},{"pos":8,"ar":"دُونِ","en_gloss":"other than Allah","transliteration":"dūni","verse_key":"10:37"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"other than Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"10:37"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِن","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākin","verse_key":"10:37"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تَصْدِيقَ","en_gloss":"(it is) a confirmation","transliteration":"taṣdīqa","verse_key":"10:37"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(of that) which","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"10:37"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بَيْنَ","en_gloss":"(was) before it","transliteration":"bayna","verse_key":"10:37"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَدَيْهِ","en_gloss":"(was) before it","transliteration":"yadayhi","verse_key":"10:37"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَتَفْصِيلَ","en_gloss":"and a detailed explanation","transliteration":"watafṣīla","verse_key":"10:37"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābi","verse_key":"10:37"},{"pos":17,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(there is) no","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"10:37"},{"pos":18,"ar":"رَيْبَ","en_gloss":"doubt","transliteration":"rayba","verse_key":"10:37"},{"pos":19,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"10:37"},{"pos":20,"ar":"مِ